                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>FLOODING NO LONGER EXPECTED AT CLARENDON WEIR AND OLD NOARLUNGA</p>

				<p/>
				<p>River levels along the Onkaparinga River peaked just below the minor flood levels on Tuesday morning following heavy rain Monday into Tuesday. Flooding is no longer expected. Mt Bold Reservoir remains around 94 percent full.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
